# Keep the small review/index files in Git. Actual execution data and binaries
# remain local and are preserved in the checksummed handoff archive.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/*.md
!/*.tsv
!/*.json
!/*.patch
!/SHA256SUMS
/handoff-file-map.json
!/change-review/
/change-review/*
!/change-review/*.patch
!/change-review/inventory.json
